rop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(226, 232, 240); color: rgb(18, 28, 45); font-family: TwilioSansText, &quot;Inter var experimental&quot;, &quot;Inter var&quot;, -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 24px;\">Prerequisites for CNAM</span></strong></p><p data-end=\"1231\" data-start=\"1125\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\">Any entity with a valid&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"1181\" data-start=\"1149\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">business registration number</strong> may sign up for CNAM.</span></p><p data-end=\"1412\" data-start=\"1314\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><strong data-end=\"1331\" data-start=\"1317\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Important:</strong>&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(184, 49, 47); font-size: 14px;\">Registering for CNAM for a sole proprietor without an EIN is not supported currently.</span></strong></p><p data-end=\"1412\" data-start=\"1314\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><hr style=\"box-sizing: content-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-top-color: rgb(238, 238, 238); border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; height: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; clear: both; user-select: none; break-after: page; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h3 data-end=\"1855\" data-start=\"1825\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.17em; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 24px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Where is CNAM Supported?</strong></span></h3><p data-end=\"1917\" data-start=\"1856\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\">Currently, CNAM is supported <strong data-end=\"1914\" data-start=\"1885\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">only in the United States</strong>.</span></p><p data-end=\"2099\" data-start=\"1919\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\">That said, CNAM coverage in the U.S. is still limited, working reliably in less than <strong data-end=\"2020\" data-start=\"2004\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">20% of cases</strong>. This is why some customers may not always see your business name displayed.</span></p><p data-end=\"2099\" data-start=\"1919\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><hr style=\"box-sizing: content-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-top-color: rgb(238, 238, 238); border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; height: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; clear: both; user-select: none; break-after: page; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><p data-end=\"1412\" data-start=\"1314\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p data-end=\"1412\" data-start=\"1314\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 24px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Why Doesn\u2019t CNAM Work All the Time?</strong></span></p><p data-end=\"2180\" data-start=\"2148\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\">CNAM faces several challenges:</p><ul data-end=\"2698\" data-start=\"2182\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><li data-end=\"2390\" data-start=\"2182\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"2390\" data-start=\"2184\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong data-end=\"2208\" data-start=\"2184\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Data inconsistencies</strong>: Carriers pull data from one of 8 different CNAM databases, often choosing the cheapest option. This creates reliability issues such as outdated or incorrect data being displayed.</p></li><li data-end=\"2698\" data-start=\"2392\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"2698\" data-start=\"2394\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong data-end=\"2420\" data-start=\"2394\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Limited consumer reach</strong>: CNAM is widely bundled with landline services, but for mobile phones, it\u2019s often a <strong data-end=\"2524\" data-start=\"2505\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">premium feature</strong>. Since most mobile devices already display the contact name saved in the phone, adoption is limited. As a result, CNAM penetration is less than <strong data-end=\"2695\" data-start=\"2669\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">20% among mobile users</strong>.</p></li><li data-end=\"2698\" data-start=\"2392\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Not all carriers support CNAM. Even if they do, the recipient must have a <strong data-end=\"470\" data-start=\"428\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">carrier plan that includes CNAM lookup</strong> (it\u2019s often a paid or premium feature, especially on mobile).</li></ul><p class=\"css-tcah8o\" data-paste-core-version=\"21.0.0\" data-paste-element=\"PARAGRAPH\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0px; --tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color