-Menu?\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\">What is a Service Menu?</h2><p data-identifyelement=\"516\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"517\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"602\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"603\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"604\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px;\">The Service Menu is a<span data-identifyelement=\"500\">&nbsp;</span><strong data-identifyelement=\"605\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">centralized</strong><span data-identifyelement=\"501\">&nbsp;</span>page to list all your services in one streamlined scheduling link. Imagine<span data-identifyelement=\"502\">&nbsp;</span><strong data-identifyelement=\"606\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">neatly categorized</strong><span data-identifyelement=\"503\">&nbsp;</span>services, making navigation a breeze. What's more, your clients can access this menu to seamlessly<span data-identifyelement=\"504\">&nbsp;</span><strong data-identifyelement=\"607\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">book multiple services</strong><span data-identifyelement=\"505\">&nbsp;</span>for themselves or even for their<span data-identifyelement=\"506\">&nbsp;</span><strong data-identifyelement=\"608\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">guests</strong>, all through a<span data-identifyelement=\"507\">&nbsp;</span><strong data-identifyelement=\"609\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">single booking widget.</strong></span></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"602\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"518\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"519\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"614\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"520\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"615\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">The Service Menu displays the chosen<span data-identifyelement=\"508\">&nbsp;</span><strong data-identifyelement=\"617\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><a data-identifyelement=\"492\" href=\"https://help.gohighlevel.com/en/support/solutions/articles/155000001159\" rel=\"noreferrer\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 92, 197); user-select: auto;\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a data-identifyelement=\"502\" href=\"155000001375.html\">Service Calendars.</a></strong> A Service Calendar is a<span data-identifyelement=\"509\">&nbsp;</span><strong data-identifyelement=\"618\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">tailored</strong><span data-identifyelement=\"510\">&nbsp;</span>calendar type created for service-based businesses. In this calendar type, users can<span data-identifyelement=\"511\">&nbsp;</span><strong data-identifyelement=\"619\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">create different services</strong>, assign staff,<span data-identifyelement=\"512\">&nbsp;</span><strong data-identifyelement=\"620\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">group</strong><span data-identifyelement=\"513\">&nbsp;</span>them together by categories, and display all of them in one single scheduling link - the<span data-identifyelement=\"514\">&nbsp;</span><strong data-identifyelement=\"621\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Service Menu.</strong></span></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"622\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"521\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"623\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"625\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></span></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"626\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"627\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Aria