and-publishing-products-in-a-location", "title": "Overview", "folder": "Ecommerce", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155042397131/original/_Pr2tNILV7Sc-nzlyS-86hBRMvN-D5yFJgc7ee.png?1740718460", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155042397639/original/jAfuLtZjro7kzuRiJhe89bycJ5b_medO7w450e.png?1740719506", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155042694834/original/Bu5rVe0jb686xVPUegyiou8S6BxA6ox-AQdfca.png?1741176462", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155042695045/original/ASM4B_3PKCpjYGrFBaYcOadKJUj_hMsNAg0365.png?1741176598", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155042696029/original/Aoi5teSDR1hVmAjsLjbWR54-0ASQaoKI0A99ee.png?1741177180", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155042696615/original/hcDuF0uWVpK-ZPaKxiV3JJw82U5NWtAfxQ364d.png?1741177558", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155042703826/original/a_9eM5hKkZj3M_UKflaZUJKwH96rHlPArg973c.png?1741181325"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<h2>Overview</h2><p dir=\"ltr\">This guide walks you through the process of creating a product in your location. By following these steps, you can add and manage products seamlessly.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><h2>Steps to Create a Product</h2><h3 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Step 1: Navigate to the Product Section</strong></h3><ol><li dir=\"ltr\">Navigate to <strong dir=\"ltr\">Payments</strong> &gt; <strong>Products</strong>.</li><li dir=\"ltr\">Click on <strong>Add Product</strong> to create a new product.<br><br><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155042397131/original/_Pr2tNILV7Sc-nzlyS-86hBRMvN-D5yFJgc7ee.png?1740718460\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155042397131\"></li></ol><h3 dir=\"ltr\"><br><strong>Step 2: Enter Product Information</strong><br><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155042397639/original/jAfuLtZjro7kzuRiJhe89bycJ5b_medO7w450e.png?1740719506\" style=\"width: 634px; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155042397639\"></h3><ol><li dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">\"Include in Online Store\" toggle&nbsp;</strong>- Enable the toggle if you want to publish the product in your Ecommerce store.</li><li><strong dir=\"ltr\">Product Name</strong> \u2013 Enter a unique and descriptive name for your product.</li><li><strong dir=\"ltr\">Description</strong> \u2013 Provide a detailed product description. You can format it using rich text options.</li><li dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Media</strong> - Upload images in the order you want it to be displayed</li><li dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Enable Product Label</strong> <em><strong>(for Ecommerce Stores)</strong></em> \u2013 Product label can be added on the products in stores. Store owners can set the time period visibility as well for the labels, post which labels will get removed.</li><li dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Collections</strong> \u2013 Assign the product to one or more collections for better organization in stores. Users can search and assign the product to multiple collections. If no collection exists, then new collections can be created and products can be added by clicking \"+\" button alongside the search bar.<br><br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155042694834/original/Bu5rVe0jb686xVPUegyiou8S6BxA6ox-AQdfca.png?1741176462\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"155042694834\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; padding: 0px 1px; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0px; width: 278px;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"><br><br></li><li dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Product Taxes -&nbsp;</strong>Users can select tax code for automatic tax calculation by choosing from the dropdown.&nbsp;<ol style=\"list-style-type: lower-alpha;\"><li dir=\"ltr\">For Include tax in prices:<ol style=\"list-style-type: lower-roman;\"><li dir=\"ltr\">As per global settings - If Global settings chosen, then the global default tax settings will be applied for whether to include or exclude the taxes in product price.</li><li dir=\"ltr\">Yes - Tax will be included in the purchase price which gets displayed.</li><li dir=\"ltr\">No - Tax will not be included in product prices before checkout. At the final step taxes will be added separately.</li></ol></li><li dir=\"ltr\">Attach tax rates - manual tax rates can be attached with the products. This will be added if enabled along with automatic taxes. &nbsp;<br><br><br><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155042695045/original/ASM4B_3PKCpjYGrFBaYcOadKJUj_hMsNAg0365.png?1741176598\" style=\"width: 590px; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155042695045\"></li></ol></li></ol><h3 dir=\"ltr\"><br><strong>Step 3: Set Pricing</strong></h3><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.17em; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155042696029/original/Aoi5teSDR1hVmAjsLjbWR54-0ASQaoKI0A99ee.png?1741177180\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"155042696029\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; padding: 0px 1px; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: auto;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" alt=\"Price creation image\"></h3><ol><li><strong dir=\"ltr\">Pricing Name <span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">\u2013 Enter the price name that you want.</span><br></strong></li><li dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Pricing Type</strong> \u2013 It can be either Onetime or Recurring. On choosing Onetime, a fix one time amount will be set for the product. For Recurring price, Billing period (time duration can be selected as per needed), Trial period, Number of payments and Setup Fee needs to be defined.<br><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155042696615/original/hcDuF0uWVpK-ZPaKxiV3JJw82U5NWtAfxQ364d.png?1741177558\" style=\"width: 479px; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155042696615\" alt=\"Recurring price type image\"><br><br></li><li><strong dir=\"ltr\">Compare-at Price</strong> (Optional) \u2013 Set a higher price to show discounts.</li><li dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Track Inventory</strong>\u2013 Enable if you want to track sock levels automatically.<ol style=\"list-style-type: lower-alpha;\"><li dir=\"ltr\">Define the Available Quantity when track inventory is enabled</li></ol></li><li dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Continue Selling when out of stock&nbsp;</strong>- If enabled, product will be available for purchase by customers irrespective of available quantity.</li><li dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Additional Option</strong> - Price description can be defined and a membership offer can be enabled and attached.</li></ol><h3 dir=\"ltr\"><br></h3><h3 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Step 4: Variant configuration<br></strong><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155042703826/original/a_9eM5hKkZj3M_UKflaZUJKwH96rHlPArg973c.png?1741181325\" style=\"width: 479px; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155042703826\"></h3><ol><li dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Option name&nbsp;</strong>- Enable Variants if the product has multiple options (e.g., size, color).</li><li dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Option values&nbsp;</strong>- &nbsp;Define Variant values (e.g., \"Color\" with values like \"Red, Blue, Green\").</li><li dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Price</strong> \u2013 Set a higher price that will be shown at checkout.</li><li dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Compare-at Price</strong> (Optional) \u2013 Set a higher price to show discounts.</li></ol>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000004290-troubleshooting-tool-for-calendar", "title": "Troubleshooting Tool for Calendar", "folder": "Calendars", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155032459196/original/0b8JJyw74j9WtcudfChMClZQC3miW43cBwc3dd.png?1725789360", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155032459206/original/j7uoLkDougKA8GAJvpy7fciH6GHEGjQ8Ow5553.png?1725789396", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155032459213/original/xHldAGh33cE0JyNGSBxqGew0nTTySNWTmQeec6.png?1725789438"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p class=\"fd-toc\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">TABLE OF CONTENTS</strong></p><ul><li><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Overview\">Overview</a></li><li><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#How-to-Use-the-Troubleshooting-Tool?\">How to Use the Troubleshooting Tool?</a></li><li><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#List-of-Codes-&amp;-Descriptions\">List of Codes &amp; Descriptions</a></li><li><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Important-notes:\">Important Notes</a></li></ul><hr><p></p><h3 id=\"Overview\"><strong dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Overview</span></strong></h3><p style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">The Troubleshooting Tool is designed to help users identify why specific calendar slots are unavailable in the booking widget. By providing detailed insights into slot availability, users can easily understand the reasons behind unavailable slots and take corrective action if needed.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Whether it's an issue with user availability, system settings, or a conflicting event, the tool offers a transparent view, ensuring that users can optimize their calendar settings for seamless booking experiences.</span></p><hr><h3 id=\"How-to-Use-the-Troubleshooting-Tool?\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">How to Use the Troubleshooting Tool?</strong></span></h3><h3 id=\"1.-Access-the-Tool:\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">1. Access the Tool:</strong></span></h3><ul><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Navigate to <strong>Calendar Settings</strong>.</span></li><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Select the calendar you want to troubleshoot.</span></li><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Click the three dots menu (<strong>\u22ee</strong>) and select <strong>Troubleshoot Calendar</strong>.</span></li></ul><p><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155032459196/original/0b8JJyw74j9WtcudfChMClZQC3miW43cBwc3dd.png?1725789360\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155032459196\"></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">2. View Slots:</strong></span></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">The troubleshooting view will display all potential slots<strong dir=\"ltr\">.</strong></span></li><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">For each unavailable slot, a code (with a description) will indicate the reason for its unavailability.</span></li></ul><p><br></p><p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155032459206/original/j7uoLkDougKA8GAJvpy7fciH6GHEGjQ8Ow5553.png?1725789396\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155032459206\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155032459213/original/xHldAGh33cE0JyNGSBxqGew0nTTySNWTmQeec6.png?1725789438\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155032459213\"></p><p><br></p><hr><h3 id=\"List-of-Codes-&amp;-Descriptions\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">List of Codes &amp; Descriptions</strong></span></h3><p><br></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Below are the possible codes explaining why a slot is not available for booking:</span></p><p><br></p><ul style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">USER:</strong> No user is available because they are either blocked by another event or fall outside their set availability.</span></li><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">COLLECTIVE:</strong> 1 or more users are unavailable for the collective appointment.</span></li><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">CONFLICT:</strong> A third-party event is blocking this slot.</span></li><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">BOOKED:</strong> A system appointment is already scheduled at this time.</span></li><li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">BLOCKED:</strong> A blocked-off time has been added for this duration.</span></li><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">NOTICE:</strong> The slot cannot be shown due to the minimum scheduling notice requirement.</span></li><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">TOOFAR:</strong> The slot is outside the allowed date range.</span></li><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">DAYLIMIT:</strong> The maximum number of appointments for the day has been reached.</span></li><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">SLOTMAX:</strong> The maximum number of appointments for this slot has been reached.</span></li><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">BUFFER:</strong> A pre/post buffer is applied, blocking this slot.</span></li><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>DURATION:</strong> The appointment duration is longer than the available time.</span></li><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>PAST:</strong> This slot is in the past.</span></li><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>LOOKBUSY:</strong> This slot is hidden due to the 'Look Busy' setting.</span></li><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>NO SEATS:</strong> The maximum number of available seats has been reached.</span></li><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>RESOURCE:</strong> A required resource (e.g., room or equipment) is not available.</span></li></ul><hr><h3 id=\"Important-Notes:\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Important Notes:</strong></span></h3><ul><li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">The tool first checks your calendar\u2019s availability and meeting intervals to generate all potential slots. It then shows which of these slots are available and which are not.</span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></li><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">For example, if your calendar availability is set from 10 AM to 12 PM and 6 PM to 8 PM with 60-minute meeting intervals, only the 10 AM, 11 AM, 6 PM, and 7 PM slots will be displayed, and their availability or unavailability will be shown accordingly for these four slots. If the calendar is unavailable on Saturdays, no slots will appear for that day.</span></li></ul>\n\t"}, {"slug": "48001231670", "title": "Why are my Calls marked as Spam and how can I avoid it", "folder": "LeadConnector Phone", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155050868458/original/r8cVIysfLerVMyT_YhT3c4ja4sjHxvd1uw7b19.png?1754297295", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155050868460/original/OddZgB6aRQ0406LEcExqBFsJkmH141QXKQf0e5.png?1754297297", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155050868812/original/NceJkOCO5cMRubQtLFcVldACOD750ZVu7gd3e2.png?1754297594", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155050868669/original/lmPxN5Jfa3o1ZARjMLl00oEwGnKGrRLM2wb4cf.png?1754297469"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding-top: 4px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 24px;\">Overview&nbsp;</span></strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding-top: 4px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">If your business calls are being flagged as 'Spam Likely' or 'Scam,' it can reduce answer rates and harm your credibility. This guide explains why calls are marked as spam and provides actionable steps to prevent it.</span></p><p><br></p><hr><p class=\"fd-toc\"><strong>TABLE OF CONTENTS</strong></p><ul><ul><li><a href=\"#Why-Are-Calls-Marked-as-Spam?\">Why Are Calls Marked as Spam?</a><ul><li><a href=\"#Common-Reasons-for-Spam-Labelling%3A\">Common Reasons for Spam Labelling:</a></li></ul></li><li><a href=\"#Key-Impacts-of-Calls-Being-Marked-as-Spam\">Key Impacts of Calls Being Marked as Spam</a></li><li><a href=\"#How-to-Prevent-Your-Calls-from-Being-Marked-as-Spam\">How to Prevent Your Calls from Being Marked as Spam</a></li></ul><li><a href=\"#Why-Turn-On-Voice-Integrity?\">Why Turn On Voice Integrity?</a><ul><li><a href=\"#What-You-Need-to-Get-Started\">What You Need to Get Started</a></li><li><a href=\"#What-Happens-After-You-Register?\">What Happens After You Register?</a><ul><li><a href=\"#2.-Enable-SHAKEN/STIR-Authentication-(U.S.-Only)\">2. Enable SHAKEN/STIR Authentication (U.S. Only)</a></li><li><a href=\"#Note-%C2%A0An-EIN-(Employer-Identification-Number)-is-required-to-complete-SHAKEN/STIR-registration.%C2%A0If-you-don%E2%80%99t-have-an-EIN,-we-recommend-registering-your-number-with-the-Free-call-registry-instead.\">Note-&nbsp;An EIN (Employer Identification Number) is required to complete SHAKEN/STIR registration.&nbsp;If you don\u2019t have an EIN, we recommend registering your number with the Free call registry instead.</a></li><li><a href=\"#3.-Update-CNAM-(Caller-Name-Presentation)-Information\">3. Update CNAM (Caller Name Presentation) Information</a></li></ul></li><li><a href=\"#Frequently-Asked-Questions\">Frequently Asked Questions</a></li></ul></li></ul><hr><h2 id=\"Why-Are-Calls-Marked-as-Spam?\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 24px;\">Why Are Calls Marked as Spam?</span></strong></h2><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\">Carriers and mobile devices use algorithms to detect and flag suspicious calls. If your number is labeled as spam, customers may ignore or block your calls, impacting your business communication.</span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h3 id=\"Common-Reasons-for-Spam-Labelling:\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.17em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\">Common Reasons for Spam Labelling:</span></strong></h3><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><ul data-spread=\"false\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\">High Call Volumes:</span></strong><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;Making too many calls in a short time can trigger spam filters.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></span></p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Unfamiliar Numbers:</strong> Calls from numbers not recognized by the recipient or without proper caller ID.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></span></p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Frequent Customer Complaints:</strong> If your number has been reported as spam multiple times.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></span></p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Low Engagement Rates:</strong> If a high percentage of your calls go unanswered or are rejected.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></span></p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">SHAKEN/STIR Authentication Failures:</strong> If your caller ID isn\u2019t verified, it may be flagged.</span></p></li></ul><p><br></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></p><p><br></p><h2 id=\"Key-Impacts-of-Calls-Being-Marked-as-Spam\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"