: 22px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; display: block; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, SFUI, HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">Explore more on the LC Phone System <a href=\"48001226976.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Trust Center here</a>.</div>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000001378-rooms-and-equipments", "title": "Rooms and Equipments", "folder": "Calendars", "images": [], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p class=\"fd-toc\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">In this Article</strong></p><ul><li><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#What-are-Rooms?\">What are Rooms?</a></li><li><a href=\"#What-are-Equipments?\">What are Equipments?</a></li><li><a href=\"#How-to-use-Rooms-&amp;-Equipments?\">How to use Rooms &amp; Equipments?</a></li></ul><p><br></p><p data-identifyelement=\"489\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"518\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"490\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Related Articles</strong></span></p><ul data-identifyelement=\"491\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><li data-identifyelement=\"512\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><a href=\"155000001473.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">How to create Rooms?</a><a href=\"https://help.gohighlevel.com/en/support/solutions/articles/155000001474\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" dir=\"ltr\"></a></li><li data-identifyelement=\"512\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><a href=\"https://help.gohighlevel.com/en/support/solutions/articles/155000001475\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" dir=\"ltr\"></a><a href=\"155000001476.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">How to create Equipments?</a></li><li data-identifyelement=\"512\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"519\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><a data-identifyelement=\"520\" href=\"https://help.gohighlevel.com/en/support/solutions/articles/155000001159\" dir=\"ltr\"></a><a href=\"https://help.gohighlevel.com/en/support/solutions/articles/155000001159\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" dir=\"ltr\"></a><a href=\"155000001375.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Service Calendar</a></span></li><li data-identifyelement=\"512\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"519\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><a href=\"155000001376.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Service Menu</a></span></li></ul><hr class=\"ql-divider\" data-identifyelement=\"523\"><h4 class=\"ql-heading\" data-block-id=\"block-9c86dbec-0b95-45ac-a08a-babfbbf23e26\" data-identifyelement=\"524\" id=\"What-are-Rooms?\"><span data-identifyelement=\"525\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"526\">What are Rooms?</strong></span></h4><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-7d8f4ccd-5052-4d67-9d92-9096afbfdd94\" data-identifyelement=\"527\"><span data-identifyelement=\"528\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\">A 'room' can represent any location where services are provided. In simple terms, a room is a specific place in your business <strong data-identifyelement=\"529\">where you conduct services.</strong> For Example: This could be Massage Rooms, Salon chairs, Workout areas, Pedicure Stations etc.</span></div><p data-identifyelement=\"530\"><span data-identifyelement=\"531\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"532\"></span></p><h4 class=\"ql-heading\" data-block-id=\"block-95392224-99d0-4e19-978a-3a5b4fab7148\" data-identifyelement=\"533\" id=\"What-are-Equipments?\"><span data-identifyelement=\"534\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"535\">What are Equipments?</strong></span></h4><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-9e9452bd-1971-4c7b-88e2-c6b2f22f9a34\" data-identifyelement=\"536\"><span data-identifyelement=\"537\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Think of equipment as the special <strong data-identifyelement=\"538\">tools and devices</strong> that businesses use to provide their services. It can be anything from a fancy machine to a simple chair. For example, picture a hyper-facial machine that's used during a facial appointment.</span></div><hr class=\"ql-divider\" data-identifyelement=\"539\"><h4 class=\"ql-heading\" data-block-id=\"block-aa7700f9-8d1d-4454-ba56-ffb9e9777409\" data-identifyelement=\"540\" id=\"How-to-use-Rooms-&amp;-Equipments?\"><span data-identifyelement=\"541\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"542\">How to use Rooms &amp; Equipments?</strong></span></h4><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-f32eadc3-8e1d-4972-8037-6bc76ec05d7a\" data-identifyelement=\"543\"><span data-identifyelement=\"544\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\">This feature is designed specifically for service-based businesses, which typically operate from physical locations and often require specialized equipment to deliver their services. Examples include doctors' offices, salons, healthcare providers, and beauty treatments.</span></div><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-8bfd8103-4430-4547-b993-2d09f5b87fa1\" data-identifyelement=\"545\"><span data-identifyelement=\"546\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Here's how to use this feature effectively:</span></div><ol data-identifyelement=\"547\"><li data-identifyelement=\"548\"><span data-identifyelement=\"549\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"550\" dir=\"ltr\">Create Rooms and Equipments:</strong></span><ul data-identifyelement=\"551\"><li data-identifyelement=\"552\"><span data-identifyelement=\"553\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\">You can create rooms used by your business and maintain a list of available equipment. These can be tailored to your specific needs.</span></li></ul></li><li data-identifyelement=\"554\"><span data-identifyelement=\"555\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"556\">Associate with Service Calendars:</strong></span><ul data-identifyelement=\"557\"><li data-identifyelement=\"558\"><span data-identifyelement=\"559\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Link these rooms and equipment to your service calendars. This way, each booking will automatically reserve the required rooms and/or equipment.</span></li></ul></li><li data-identifyelement=\"560\"><span data-identifyelement=\"561\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"562\">Avoid Double Bookings:</strong></span><ul data-identifyelement=\"563\"><li data-identifyelement=\"564\"><span data-identifyelement=\"565\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\">When handling bookings, the system will consider both user availability and the availability of rooms/equipment. This helps prevent double bookings not only with staff members but also with rooms and equipment.</span></li></ul></li></ol><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-70e98779-e056-4ef4-a801-c3f6698baf27\" data-identifyelement=\"566\"><span data-identifyelement=\"567\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\">By following these steps, you can streamline the booking process and ensure that resources such as rooms and equipment are efficiently utilized, enhancing the overall service experience for your customers.</span></div>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000004293-collect-payments-with-recurring-appointments-booking-widget-", "title": "Collect Payments with Recurring Appointments (Booking Widget)", "folder": "Calendars", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155035007141/original/qYI06uMNznzYD34iHbLB-b1wCgR74jztYQcde1.png?1729324949", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155035007145/original/7vwvcHVaIj-Q5gt1oI041k3oc-xjyzk13Q302c.png?1729324964", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155035007190/original/CeGbe7JXMN_0xY21T71rus7Yl8_Oe1cqxg84ae.png?1729325133"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p class=\"fd-toc\"><strong>TABLE OF CONTENTS</strong></p><ul><li><a href=\"#Payment-Options-for-Recurring-Appointment\">Payment Options for Recurring Appointment</a></li><li><a href=\"#How-to-Set-This-Up\">How to Set This Up</a></li></ul><p><br></p><hr><p></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Recurring appointments are appointments that repeat according to a set schedule, such as daily, weekly, or monthly.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Payment-Options-for-Recurring-Appointment\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Payment Options for Recurring Appointment</strong></h3><p dir=\"ltr\">You can accept payments for recurring appointments on the booking widget with two options:</p><ol><li><strong dir=\"ltr\">Collect Payment for First Appointment Only</strong><ul><li dir=\"ltr\">The payment is collected for the initial appointment only. For example, if you have 3 recurring appointments and the price is $50 per appointment, you will collect $50 at the time of booking. Subsequent payments for the remaining appointments will need to be collected manually.</li></ul></li><li><strong dir=\"ltr\">Collect Payment for All Appointments</strong><ul><li dir=\"ltr\">The total amount is collected at the time of booking, covering all appointments in the series. For example, for 3 recurring appointments at $50 each, a total of $150 is collected upfront. However, the final amount charged may vary depending on how many appointments are actually booked. This could change based on your availability and the settings you\u2019ve configured for handling unavailability.</li></ul></li></ol><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Note:&nbsp;</strong><strong>Recurring Calendars do not support partial payments.</strong></p><hr><h3 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"How-to-Set-This-Up\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">How to Set This Up</strong></h3><p><br></p><p><strong dir=\"ltr\">1. Go to Calendar Settings</strong>:</p><ul><li dir=\"ltr\">Navigate to <strong>Calendar Settings</strong> and select the calendar you wish to configure.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong dir=\"ltr\">2. Ensure Recurring Meetings and Payment Provider Are Set Up</strong>:</p><ul><li dir=\"ltr\">Make sure <strong>Recurring Meetings</strong> are enabled (go to <strong>Calendar &gt; Availability Tab</strong>) and your payment provider is integrated (check <strong>Payments Module &gt; Integration</strong>).</li></ul><p><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155035007141/original/qYI06uMNznzYD34iHbLB-b1wCgR74jztYQcde1.png?1729324949\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155035007141\"></p><p><br></p><p><strong dir=\"ltr\">3. Configure Payment Options</strong>:</p><ul><li dir=\"ltr\">In the selected calendar, go to the <strong>Forms and Payments</strong> tab.</li><li dir=\"ltr\">Under <strong>Accept Payments</strong>, if recurring appointments are enabled, you will see options to <strong dir=\"ltr\">Collect Payment for First Appointment Only</strong> or <strong>Collect Payment for All Appointments</strong>.</li><li dir=\"ltr\">Choose your preferred option and click <strong>Save</strong>.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155035007145/original/7vwvcHVaIj-Q5gt1oI041k3oc-xjyzk13Q302c.png?1729324964\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155035007145\"></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155035007190/original/CeGbe7JXMN_0xY21T71rus7Yl8_Oe1cqxg84ae.png?1729325133\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155035007190\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">With these settings, payments for recurring appointments will be handled according to your selected option.</p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "48001226590", "title": "LeadConnector How to Set Up a Dedicated Sending Domain Within a SubAccount", "folder": "LeadConnector Email", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48265938968/original/spw7PyvCIf6DlxRXiukwE1KRAbxsW5nK9wa053.png?1669638686", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48266011842/original/2vSwdC8UDRIvgg8Nxg03cX3oivgmKwUnjgf650.png?1669651395", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48266019581/original/ULirlt2iKm4tlyTAcqEPEbZngi4m5KFHHgb4dc.png?1669653005", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155044534677/original/AhwYYnbjZAeBkUwuL5YfHhJDs1uh97xpsQa3f0.png?1743762209", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155044883184/original/y_tZkZ81wptjB7EhY1Kc1SiyyeRQKv6wEQb510.png?1744290850", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155044883139/original/2L9UE5joSnseGJ1dYnzonDBt82Pz3oZsqwa92d.png?1744290802", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155021698396/original/XSYQYyqpEIm0mh30456h9k4v29Sno1nZvQ2982.png?1709045698", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48266012249/original/qQB-C0oyNt3QXlikSuDZ3ZxqtHbcEOojDAee69.png?1669651447", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48266012644/original/HId6bwZLXtHzQVMcReIBVLpozaZfBkBxeA389a.png?1669651502", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48266013445/original/b7skmFdUBgDZk-CxtpZf9QmzCA6QjuWwygf2da.png?1669651666", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48266012833/original/k-MlboH-Tv8bVGcsspHLBwjpB9fDq5K9xAb51c.png?1669651545"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p class=\"fd-toc tdfocus-1669650509444\" data-identifyelement=\"505\" dir=\"ltr\">Email marketing is a great way to reach customers and increase sales. But if you're not careful, you could end up in trouble. A dedicated sending domain gives you control over what appears to be coming from your business. That means you can avoid spam filters and other issues that might make your messages get caught by unwanted mail servers.<br data-identifyelement=\"506\"><br data-identifyelement=\"507\">Don't let your email marketing efforts go unnoticed! Get started right away with a dedicated sending domain.</p><h4 class=\"tdfocus-1669651019095\" data-identifyelement=\"508\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"\"><br data-identifyelement=\"509\"></h4><p class=\"tdfocus-1669648193929\" data-identifyelement=\"554\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-identifyelement=\"510\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"511\">Please Note:&nbsp;</strong></span></p><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--note tdfocus-1669648201101\" data-identifyelement=\"512\" dir=\"ltr\">Dedicated sending domains are <u class=\"tdfocus-1669648218769\" data-identifyelement=\"513\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"514\">only</strong> applicable</u> to the users in the <strong class=\"tdfocus-1669648374784\" data-identifyelement=\"515\" dir=\"ltr\"><a class=\"tdfocus-1669648401037\" data-identifyelement=\"516\" dir=\"ltr\" href=\"48001225442-what-is-leadconnector-email-.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">LC - Email system</a>.</strong></pre><p data-identifyelement=\"517\"><br data-identifyelement=\"518\"></p><hr data-identifyelement=\"519\"><h4 class=\"tdfocus-1669651019095\" data-identifyelement=\"520\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Covered-in-this-article:\"><span class=\"tdfocus-1669651031825\" data-identifyelement=\"521\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1669651042400\" data-identifyelement=\"522\" dir=\"ltr\">Covered in this article:</strong></span></h4><h4 data-identifyelement=\"523\" id=\"What-is-a-Dedicated-sending-domain?\"><a data-identifyelement=\"524\" href=\"#What-is-a-Dedicated-sending-domain?\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"525\"><span data-identifyelement=\"526\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">What is a Dedicated sending domain?</span></strong></a></h4><h4 data-identifyelement=\"527\" id=\"How-to-create-a-dedicated-sending-domain?\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"528\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"529\"><a class=\"tdfocus-1669653699312\" data-identifyelement=\"530\" href=\"#How-to-create-a-dedicated-sending-domain?\">How to create a dedicated sending domain?</a></strong></span></h4><p data-identifyelement=\"531\"><a data-identifyelement=\"532\" dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#How-to-set-up-a-dedicated-sending-domain-for-Targeted-Email-Categories?\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"533\">How to set up a dedicated sending domain for Targeted Email Categories?</strong></a></p><p data-identifyelement=\"534\"><a data-identifyelement=\"535\" dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#How-to-set-up-a-default-header-for-a-dedicated-sending-domain?\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"536\">How to set up a default header for a dedicated sending domain?</strong></a></p><p><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Ability-to-turn-ON/OFF-email-tracking\"><strong>Ability to turn ON/OFF email tracking</strong></a></p><h4 class=\"tdfocus-1669653722732\" data-identifyelement=\"537\" id=\"FAQ\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"538\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"539\"><br data-identifyelement=\"540\"></strong><a class=\"tdfocus-1669653701405\" data-identifyelement=\"541\" href=\"#FAQ\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"542\">FAQ</strong></a></span></h4><ul data-identifyelement=\"543\"><li data-identifyelement=\"544\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><h4 data-identifyelement=\"545\" id=\"How-to-choose-a-sending-domain-name-for-my-account?\"><span data-identifyelement=\"546\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a data-identifyelement=\"547\" dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#How-to-choose-a-sending-domain-name-for-my-account?\">How to choose a sending domain name for my account?</a><a href=\"#I've-added-a-domain-by-not-verified-at-the-time/some-of-the-records-are-not-verified,-How-to-verify?\" dir=\"ltr\" data-identifyelement=\"548\"></a></span></h4></li><li data-identifyelement=\"549\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><h4 data-identifyelement=\"550\" id=\"I've-added-a-domain-by-not-verified-at-the-time/some-of-the-records-are-not-verified,-How-to-verify?\"><span data-identifyelement=\"551\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a data-identifyelement=\"552\" dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#I've-added-a-domain-by-not-verified-at-the-time/some-of-the-records-are-not-verified,-How-to-verify?\">I've added a domain by not verified at the time/some of the records are not verified, How to verify?</a></span></h4></li><li data-identifyelement=\"553\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><h4 data-identifyelement=\"554\" id=\"How-to-delete-a-domain?\"><span data-identifyelement=\"555\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a data-identifyelement=\"556\" dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#How-to-delete-a-domain?\">How to delete a domain?</a></span></h4></li><li data-identifyelement=\"557\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><h4 data-identifyelement=\"558\" id=\"How-to-move-sending-domain-from-Mailgun-to-LeadConnector?\"><span data-identifyelement=\"559\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a data-identifyelement=\"560\" dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#How-to-move-sending-domain-from-Mailgun-to-LeadConnector?\">How to move sending domain from Mailgun to LeadConnector?</a></span></h4></li><li data-identifyelement=\"561\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><h4 data-identifyelement=\"562\" id=\"How-to-set-a-dedicated-domain-as-active/default?\"><span data-identifyelement=\"563\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a data-identifyelement=\"564\" dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#How-to-set-a-dedicated-domain-as-active/default?\">How to set a dedicated domain as active/default?</a></span></h4></li><li data-identifyelement=\"565\"><h4 data-identifyelement=\"566\" id=\"How-to-set-up-a-dedicated-IP?\"><a data-identifyelement=\"567\" dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#How-to-set-up-a-dedicated-IP?\"><span data-identifyelement=\"568\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">How to set up a dedicated IP?</span></a></h4></li></ul><hr data-identifyelement=\"579\"><h1 class=\"tdfocus-1669648362808\" data-identifyelement=\"543\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"What-is-a-Dedicated-sending-domain?-2\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1669651843376\" data-identifyelement=\"580\" dir=\"ltr\">What is a Dedicated sending domain?</strong></h1><p class=\"tdfocus-1669648407684\" data-identifyelement=\"545\" dir=\"ltr\"><br data-identifyelement=\"581\">A dedicated sending domain allows you to send emails that appear to be coming from your brand, and this can help you maintain a better reputation with email services. Any company can create a dedicated sending domain, and it's quick and easy.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"545\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 14px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; min-height: 15px; text-align: justify;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"582\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"546\"></span></p><div class=\"step-instructions screensteps-textblock \" data-identifyelement=\"547\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(31, 33, 41); font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><p class=\"tdfocus-1669648248357\" data-identifyelement=\"548\" dir=\"ltr\">By default, all emails sent from our platform will show the name of our email-sending servers in the \"<strong data-identifyelement=\"583\">sent on behalf of</strong>\" or \"<strong data-identifyelement=\"584\">sent via</strong>\" email headers:<br data-identifyelement=\"585\"><br data-identifyelement=\"586\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"551\" dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48265938968/original/spw7PyvCIf6DlxRXiukwE1KRAbxsW5nK9wa053.png?1669638686\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib tdfocus-1669648263064 fr-bordered\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48265938968\" data-identifyelement=\"587\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"551\" dir=\"ltr\"><br data-identifyelement=\"588\"><span class=\"tdfocus-1669648280048\" data-identifyelement=\"589\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">When you set up your own custom mail server domain, you will see a different \"<strong data-identifyelement=\"590\">mailed-by</strong>\", \"<strong data-identifyelement=\"591\">sent on behalf</strong>\", or \"<strong data-identifyelement=\"592\">sent via</strong>\" field.</span></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1669648291018\" data-identifyelement=\"552\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"593\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"553\"></span></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1669648193929\" data-identifyelement=\"554\" dir=\"ltr\"><br data-identifyelement=\"594\"><br data-identifyelement=\"595\"></p><hr data-identifyelement=\"596\"><h1 class=\"tdfocus-1669648193929\" data-identifyelement=\"554\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"How-to-create-a-dedicated-sending-domain?-3\">How to create a dedicated sending domain?</h1><p class=\"tdfocus-1669648193929\" data-identifyelement=\"554\" dir=\"ltr\"><br data-identifyelement=\"597\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1669648193929\" data-identifyelement=\"554\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-identifyelement=\"598\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">You can create multiple sending domains under your account and make one active.</span></p></div><div class=\"step-instructions screensteps-textblock tdfocus-1669647770988\" data-identifyelement=\"512\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><p class=\"tdfocus-1669648025809\" data-identifyelement=\"528\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"599\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"529\"></span></p><ol class=\"tdfocus-1669652498763\" data-identifyelement=\"600\" style=\"list-style-type: lower-roman;\"><li class=\"tdfocus-1669652756329\" data-identifyelement=\"530\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify; font-size: 14px;\"><span class=\"tdfocus-1669648034549\" data-identifyelement=\"601\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Navigate to <strong data-identifyelement=\"602\">Settings</strong> - &gt; &nbsp;<strong data-identifyelement=\"603\">Email settings</strong> - &gt; &nbsp;<strong data-identifyelement=\"604\">Email Services</strong></span><br data-identifyelement=\"605\"><br data-identifyelement=\"606\"><br data-identifyelement=\"607\"></li><li class=\"tdfocus-1669652774300\" data-identifyelement=\"531\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify; font-size: 14px;\"><span class=\"tdfocus-1669648042815\" data-identifyelement=\"608\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">If you are in the LC email system, you can find the Dedicated domain button, else please switch to the LC email system to create a custom sending domain.</span><br data-identifyelement=\"609\"><br data-identifyelement=\"610\"><br data-identifyelement=\"611\"></li><li data-identifyelement=\"533\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span class=\"tdfocus-1669652779878\" data-identifyelement=\"612\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Click the '<strong data-identifyelement=\"613\">Dedicated domain</strong>' button<img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48266011842/original/2vSwdC8UDRIvgg8Nxg03cX3oivgmKwUnjgf650.png?1669651395\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib tdfocus-1669648453434\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; padding: 0px 1px; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; color: rgb(31, 33, 41); font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0px; width: auto;\" data-id=\"48266011842\" data-identifyelement=\"614\"></span><br data-identifyelement=\"615\"><br data-identifyelement=\"616\"></li><li class=\"tdfocus-1669652491052\" data-identifyelement=\"533\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span class=\"tdfocus-1669652801122\" data-identifyelement=\"617\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Add your domain details</span><br data-identifyelement=\"618\"><br data-identifyelement=\"619\"><span data-identifyelement=\"620\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"621\" dir=\"ltr\">Here are instructions for common providers:</strong></span><table data-identifyelement=\"622\" style=\"width: 100%;\"><tbody data-identifyelement=\"623\"><tr data-identifyelement=\"624\"><td class=\"tdfocus-1669652621677\" data-identifyelement=\"625\" style=\"width: 50.0000%;\"><ul class=\"tdfocus-1669652577978\